NAME:
   redpanda-connect list - List all Redpanda Connect component types

USAGE:
   redpanda-connect list [command options]

DESCRIPTION:
   If any component types are explicitly listed then only types of those
   components will be shown.

     redpanda-connect list
     redpanda-connect list --format json inputs output
     redpanda-connect list rate-limits buffers

   When using --format jsonschema with bloblang-functions or bloblang-methods,
   you can optionally specify function or method names to retrieve metadata for
   only those specific items:

     redpanda-connect list --format jsonschema bloblang-functions
     redpanda-connect list --format jsonschema bloblang-functions uuid_v4
     redpanda-connect list --format jsonschema bloblang-functions uuid_v4 nanoid
     redpanda-connect list --format jsonschema bloblang-methods uppercase catch

OPTIONS:
   --format value                                               Print the component list in a specific format. Options are text, json, jsonschema, or cue. (default: "text")
   --status value                                               Filter the component list to only those matching the given status. Options are stable, beta or experimental.
   --templates value, -t value [ --templates value, -t value ]  EXPERIMENTAL: import Redpanda Connect templates, supports glob patterns (requires quotes)
   --help, -h                                                   show help
